    "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 26 at 12:52AM EST by NWS Charleston WV",
    "description": "Rain will continue to overspread the region this morning. However,\nthere will be a layer of cold air, with temperatures at or just\nbelow freezing along the higher ridges above 3,000 feet, causing\nprecipitation to fall as freezing rain. Light ice accretions may\noccur through about 6 AM EST before precipitation transitions\nback to rain for the remainder of the day. Please use extra\ncaution when traveling this morning.",
